WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.544 --> 00:00:04.921
Come forth, those who tear asunder!

00:00:07.257 --> 00:00:08.675
Y&amp;amp;T! Snow Wolf Supreme Roar!

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:14.723
No!

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:19.519
That was close.

00:00:22.564 --> 00:00:26.860
How dare you kill my dear pets?

00:00:26.943 --> 00:00:29.738
He survived Lord Kall-Su's spell.

00:00:29.821 --> 00:00:32.032
You bastard!

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.783
A lowly human

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.828
dares to attack a noble being like me?

00:00:36.911 --> 00:00:37.912
Look.

00:00:38.496 --> 00:00:40.290
