00:00:41.666 --> 00:00:44.335
Change, Di-amon!

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:50.050
Now I'm even more gruesomely powerful!

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:53.928
Taste the true strength of a vampire!

00:00:54.012 --> 00:00:54.971
Oh no!

00:00:55.055 --> 00:00:56.723
Domain!

00:00:57.432 --> 00:00:58.975
Lord Kall-Su!

